{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b71ce4bb04ab0c4bd8b1bb5aa58b901929b4b60166865f26bb96b3f38363c939", "ja": "（今日は風花が演じる元ヤン先生ドラマの撮影。\n次は怪しいクラブに潜入するシーンだが、準備は……）", "zh": "（今天是风花出演的不良少女出身的老师题材电视剧的拍摄。下一场是潜入可疑俱乐部的戏，不过准备得……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a0c0a88f0120ec0f812b190135c4f7dd5933e14a239bb851141f27e0aff45068", "ja": "「ジロジロ見てんじゃねぇよ！！\nケンカ売ってんのか！？　あぁん！？」", "zh": "「看什么看啊！！\n想找茬是吗！？啊！？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5671ea9a7ad2e2826433d787f141231f38bb72b2942e76aff2fbc756464179bb", "ja": "ふ、風花……さん！？", "zh": "风、风花……小姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "55ed330c27f3d59de72aff0a4663be731c054cd1f2e5b400f6e8e1f99944ccbb", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c14ab5bca77ca5491110e40b958d91364decdc75c469721248295bbd9fb58ab5", "ja": "お疲れ様です。今、ちょっとウォーミングアップ\nしてました。元ヤンの先生役なので。", "zh": "辛苦了。我刚才在做热身。因为我要饰演的是曾经当过不良少年的老师。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4d44e3360850b1fc8f18d992dd6f3721dd75a4ecba094940882193209d64ecf0", "ja": "そ、そうか……うん、なかなかよかったよ。\nすごく迫力があったというか。", "zh": "这、这样啊……嗯，表现得相当不错。\n该说是很有气势吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "27e0961aa98ffe45b4c7753bea7d05350ec3d64449605087dc80129626744ad5", "ja": "本当ですか？　やったぁ♪　練習のおかげですね♪\n言葉遣いとか、けっこう不安だったんですけど。", "zh": "真的吗？太好了♪ 多亏了练习呢♪\n不过措辞什么的，我还是挺没底的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0e7b5db249ca395757760831f6b943e8f9e1338568913d7d06fed03dcdc2af46", "ja": "でも基本は情に厚い、いい先生みたいだからな。\nクラブ潜入も、あくまで生徒のためだし。", "zh": "不过，他本质上是个重感情的好老师。\n潜入俱乐部也完全是为了学生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4b424ce4e247a8f16fd7f6231b3e5e838f5f3bbb0d28bc69d40c31ecdb7d44e5", "ja": "はい♪　台本を読んだ時は、またセクシーな役？\nって思っちゃいましたけど……。", "zh": "是的♪　读剧本的时候，我还忍不住想，难道又是性感的角色？……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d2e132b141ebe5748850c64c77d530ad05c7c04a501bae89ee6c6a33e11efca6", "ja": "先輩のこのみ先生に憧れて、生徒のために頑張る\nいい先生ですよね♪　ある意味、正統派です！", "zh": "憧憬着前辈好美老师、为了学生努力的好老师呢♪　从某种意义上说，是正统派！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1010_p", "source_sha256": "abfee1a5f20e51be484a615f0821ca876231e75824cd03b3a687b35bc098ea02", "ja": "ヤンキー口調もバッチリだったし、\nこれは本番も期待できそうだな。", "zh": "不良少女的语气也拿捏得很到位，看来正式拍摄时也值得期待了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "81561c2dd45ee92dadfb2dce68bdeaadfa7f53c194da6635b4aeb840fb33dcef", "ja": "だといいんですけど、まだちょっと自信が……。\n撮影前に、もう少しだけ練習してもいいですか？", "zh": "要是那样就好了，可我还是有点没自信……\n拍摄前，可以再练习一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1012_p", "source_sha256": "eb59844691917ece2b2289dfbbbd02bf8fb3099ac9e0002de36aacef401d148a", "ja": "もちろん。……そうだ、なんなら付き合おうか？\n実際に人に向かってのほうが、つかみやすいだろう。", "zh": "当然可以。……对了，要不我陪你练练？\n实际对着人练，应该更容易掌握吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fd3ad9c3932fcc250b8c0d61aafdc35b2a218259f21a79db87f1633f4c871b44", "ja": "あ、お願いできますか？　ありがとうございます、\n助かります♪　それじゃあ……。こほん。", "zh": "啊，可以拜托您吗？谢谢您，\n帮大忙了♪ 那么……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f14b9ff1a1c2f38ce82ada529eb85557f6ec5c62f45e686611f9fd78650a8a10", "ja": "「この『聖殉覇の風花』に水着だのお色気だの、\nいい加減にしろっつってんだろうが、あぁん！？」", "zh": "“什么泳装、什么性感路线，\n我都说了别净给我整这些，听不懂人话吗，啊啊！？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a53fd3267847f1ad6a87bb52eb0b32b8a3643fb47c35ee003f50205e8f6b6a7a", "ja": "（……演技なんだよな！？）", "zh": "（……是在演戏吧！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f2aa6ae8e4d0f6ea229eff21dd8d0863f634c99607e576a2347522520acca2b6", "ja": "「今日という今日はタイマンで決着つけてやる！\n路地裏で待ってろ、このタコぉ！」", "zh": "「今天一定要跟你单挑做个了断！\n在小巷子里给我等着，你这个笨蛋混账！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "36b963c8d594ae01330a2d1d66f91c0e28f81c2100395eb8aea5d7b8b70cf01e", "ja": "ふぅ……えへへ♪\n練習ですからね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "呼……嘿嘿♪ 毕竟是在练习嘛，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f57bb0968a64cded7217a90bae189935d8d8c31bf65ada524d6b9684973be793", "ja": "お、おお……、すごい迫力だな！\n練習はもう充分だと思う！　……それじゃ失礼します。", "zh": "哦、哦哦……气势真惊人啊！\n我觉得练习已经很充分了！……那么，我先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6a402aba28a49582750d7d1ffcd1284c6f606c9bc05abe13388cced1575925f7", "ja": "あ、あれ？　{$P$}さん、\n怖がってませんか？　演技、演技ですからね！？", "zh": "啊，咦？{$P$}先生，您是不是害怕了？这是演戏、演戏而已哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e28dc7a391d0bc0dfbb522c62d18e2976990799fa9bb8c522b48e4ef29782927", "ja": "全然、本心とかじゃない、ことも、ない……ことも……\nいえあの、本当です、信じてください～！", "zh": "完全不是发自内心的……也不是说没有……也不是……  \n不，我是说，真的，请相信我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0594_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c67bd96ff518ba641812bb300b3d568df9b389a8c63bcddfb8b1b1038812c2de", "ja": "（……本番でも、風花のヤンキーぶりは評判だった。\nすごく感情が乗っていたそうで、よかった……よな？）", "zh": "（……正式演出时，风花的不良少女范也广受好评。据说她特别投入感情，太好了……对吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
